Faz recorte esférico de raio de 30 angstrons e fixa os átomos depois de 22 angstrons e otimiza.  
--------------------------------
#INPUT_TYPE pkl step02/rta_complex_mm_opt.pkl
#SPHERICAL_PRUNNING *:ARG.176:NH2 30.0
#FIXED_ATOMS *:ARG.176:NH2 22.0
#RUN_SIMULATION  Geometry_Optimization
#MAX_ITERATIONS 1000
#RMS_GRADIENT 0.1
#SAVE_PDB no
#OPT_ALG ConjugatedGradient
#LOG_FREQUENCY 10
#SAVE_NAME rta_complex_pruned_and_fixed
_____________________________
